     <h2>3. Recording of data on our website</h2>
     <p><strong>Cookies</strong></p>
     <p>In some instances, our website and its pages use so-called cookies. Cookies do not cause any damage to your computer and do not contain viruses. The purpose of cookies is to make our website more user friendly, effective and more secure. Cookies are small text files that are placed on your computer and stored by your browser.</p>
+
+    <h2>4. Accounts, third parties and tracking</h2>
+    <p><strong>Accounts</strong></p>
+    <p>If you sign up, we collect only a username and password. They are sent to our authentication service solely to create and verify your account, and are not used for advertising or profiling. Please do not use your real name or email address as a username.</p>
+    <p><strong>No third-party tracking</strong></p>
+    <p>This website does not load third-party analytics, advertising scripts or externally hosted fonts. Fonts are served from our own domain, so your IP address is not shared with font providers. Our server sets security headers and a limiting Referrer-Policy so that pages you visit are not leaked to other sites.</p>
+    <p>If this ever changes, we will update this policy and ask for your consent before any non-essential script is loaded.</p>
